        "cl_intro": "Release notes",
        "cl_body": (
            "Liquid Glass 4.0.0\n\n"
            "New\n"
            "• Settings screen fully redesigned: sub-fragment navigation "
            "(Zones, Appearance, Fine tuning, Service, Help, What's new)\n"
            "• What's new screen — scrollable changelog with plugin icon\n"
            "• Preview card on home: mock chat, α/blur metrics, Strong Glass toggle\n"
            "• Minimal centered header: Liquid Glass + version\n"
            "• RU/EN interface — auto from system language, choice in Service → Language\n"
            "• AltSeekbar — native M3 sliders (fallback to Input/Slider)\n"
            "• Welcome sheet on first launch\n"
            "• Chat menu items: Settings and Reapply\n"
            "• Conflict warnings: Glassify, Square Liquid Glass, SetLiquidGlass\n"
            "• Deep link aliases — quick jump to sections via settings search\n"
            "• Profile JSON export/import, diagnostics and debug reports\n\n"
            "Improved\n"
            "• Conditional UI: Appearance and Fine tuning hidden when effect is off; "
            "fine tuning also hidden in Eco mode\n"
            "• Zones simplified: In chat and Lists right away, hints moved to bottom\n"
            "• Shorter subtext in settings list — text no longer truncated\n"
            "• Eco mode: smaller drawable cache (72→40), fewer dialogs boot polls, "
            "gentler reapply when moving sliders\n"
            "• Dialogs boot poll skipped when list/header zones are disabled\n"
            "• Fewer redundant get_setting calls on apply — zone flags read in one pass\n"
            "• reload_settings() when toggling effect, eco and language\n"
            "• Fallback settings screen if main UI fails to build\n\n"
            "Fixed\n"
            "• Settings header no longer truncates Liquid Glass to Liq\n"
            "• Strong Glass: Android 13+ warning only when mode is enabled, "
            "no false Frosted messages\n"
            "• UI always shows Liquid Glass (Frosted label removed)\n"
            "• Support check fixed when Strong Glass is off on Android <13\n"
            "• Changelog fallback no longer cuts text at 240 characters\n"
            "• Chat menu and welcome use version from __version__\n\n"
            "Changed / removed\n"
            "• Removed non-working live chat bar (α±, Blur± in Saved Messages)\n"
            "• Removed Application areas block in Zones (Enable all / Chat only / Disable)\n"
            "• Selector tabs replaced with separate sub-fragment screens\n"
            "• Default alpha, blur, zones and eco values unchanged from 3.8.x\n\n"
            "Tips\n"
            "• Reapply refreshes the effect without restarting exteraGram\n"
            "• Strong Glass requires Android 13+\n"
            "• If glass is not visible — enable chat blur: exteraGram → Power saving"
        ),
    },
}

